        "Background": "Auren: Lines in Full\n-1 Code of Conduct (Protecting Women… Begrudgingly)\n\nAuren: Attacks\nOrion: Auren's sword, crafted from unbreakable adamantite, is as beautiful as it is deadly.\nFireball: Auren sends forth a spiralling blast of flame. Its magic continues to burn after it hits.\nIce Spire Array (Affinity: Ice; Perks: Area Effect, Armor Piercing, Overwhelming, Ranged; Flaws: Feather Blow, Ineffective): A prismatic array of frozen shards bombards multiple enemies, piercing any defenses.\nThunder Godspell (Affinity: Lightning; Perks: Accurate x2, Effective, Ranged, Stunning; Flaws: Delayed): Auren summons a bolt of electrical energy that stuns its target. It rarely misses."
